					"name": "Null Zone",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Strips the warp's protection from everything nearby — invulnerable saves falter, toughened hides thin.\n\nDesign: Affliction (10/level) delivering a Vulnerability-style disadvantage valued (by this project, not a cited RAW table entry) at roughly -20 points, +100% Malediction, +50% Area Effect, then Warp Sorcery and Severe Perils, net +130% — the setting's single most dangerous debuff, priced to match. Full modified cost: 10 x 2.3 = 23 points/level; needs Warp Empowerment level 2 (cap 30).",
