		{
			"id": "T7BjrefJADrKI-xwL",
			"name": "Telekinesis",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Force of will made physical: hurled objects, barriers of solid air, crushing grips, and — at its rarest and most dangerous — stepping instantly from one place to another. Calibrated against Dark Heresy's Telekinesis list (Assail, Kinetic Barrier/Shield, Crush, Warp Conduit/Gate of Infinity all map closely).\n\nDesign: Talent-linked group; see each child.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Mental",
				"Psyker",
				"Imperium"
			],
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "t3EomEBLToWhqA0m1",
					"name": "Assail",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Hurls the nearest loose object, or the target themselves, with bruising force.\n\nDesign: Innate Attack (Crushing, 5/die, B61) with Warp Sorcery/Perils, net -30%. Full modified cost: 5 x 0.7 = 3.5 points/level. Bought at 8 levels (8d cr) for 28 points, the default a trained battlefield psyker buys (a lesser psyker may buy fewer). Needs Warp Empowerment level 2 (cap 30) at 8 levels.",
